<title>FRANCE: Block trade in 0.97 pct of Canal Plus.</title>
<headline>Block trade in 0.97 pct of Canal Plus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers said that there had been a block trade of 300,000 shares, or 0.97 percent of the capital in in Canal Plus on Wednesday at a price of 1,175 francs.</p>
<p>At 1448 GMT, Canal Plus was 0.17 percent lower at 1,178.</p>
</text>
